WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.400
<i>This map is of the Land of the Rising Sun.</i>

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:07.230
<i>But what is this?</i>

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.110
<i>We're investigating that.</i>

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.820
<i>This wall is so hard to climb...</i>

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:47.630
<i>Is this their way of hazing me?</i>

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:51.270
<i>And it's poorly made, too.</i>

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:52.920
<i>Originally, this style of wall was</i>

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:57.120
<i>only allowed on the Imperial Palace 
or other noble households.</i>

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.390
<i>It's hard to breathe, and these 
clothes are so heavy!</i>

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:03.270
<i>I can barely move.</i>

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:04.890
<i>I guess the world of commoners</i>

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:06.030
<i>just isn't for me.</i>

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:09.060
<i>For what it's worth, the world of commoners 
refers to the normal world.</i>

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:11.590
<i>Not that I would ever want</i>

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:14.990
<i>to associate myself with 
something common, anyway.</i>

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:17.120
<i>But for now, I'll forget that.</i>

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:19.410
<i>I have a duty!</i>

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:22.740
I already told you!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:27.030
You don't understand anything about Mugai-san.

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:28.460
But, Hibachi-dono...

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.120
Listen, Tsukishima...

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:34.590
The best thing about Mugai-san 
is his solitary strength!

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.710
Oh, Mugai-san.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.690
No...

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.520
I don't think that's accurate, Hibachi-dono.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:46.310
It's the way he can make 
anyone seeing him feel safe...

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:49.330
<i>Look at those two flirting. 
Government officials shouldn't flirt!</i>

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.060
<i>It doesn't matter.</i>

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:54.820
<i>This will make it easy to reach 
my goal, the Insect Archives.</i>

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:57.280
<i>Here I go.</i>

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.820
<i>For the first time in ten years, 
I've ventured outside in person.</i>

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.590
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.870
<i>It's all for the sake of knowledge.</i>

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:07.700
I told you

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:10.850
you're wrong!

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:18.210
Hey, who's that?

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:21.640
What?

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.640
He's wearing a Noh mask!

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:27.060
No, not that! 
I mean he's an intruder!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.140
<b>The Hot Guy Beneath 
the Mask: Nagatomimaru</b>

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.690
I hate commoners...

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:39.850
You hurt me, and then
 treat me like an intruder?

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:42.760
The hearts of men have fallen so far.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.220
You should be ashamed!

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:47.370
By hearts of men, I don't mean 
these two specifically,

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.900
but the general—

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.350
What are you mumbling about, intruder?

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:53.790
Um, why did you sneak into the Magistrate?

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:57.670
When you ask someone something, you need to name yourself first.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.210
Oh, excuse me!

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.050
I am Tsukishima Jinbei!

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.050
I am Nagatomimaru.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:11.060
So what are you doing here, Nagatomimaru-kun?

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.860
I want to know everything about bugs.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:21.070
If I wish, I can get information 
and documents of any kind!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.790
Historical records, legends, Zen texts,

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.770
diaries, letters, travelogues,

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:29.580
Buddhist texts, treatises on war,

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.250
etiquette, medicine, mathematics,

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.590
astronomy, herbalism, and even foreign texts.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.230
From every obtainable text...

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:43.760
I have read accounts of the insects you fight.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:48.160
Pulp texts recounting rumors and encounters 
between townspeople and insects.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:52.600
And even secret reports which are 
never released to the public!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.310
Well? Are you impressed?

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:59.460
Yes, I am terribly impressed by your knowledge!

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.980
Is he an otaku?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.190
Excellent!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.720
Knowledge can solve any problem.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:06.950
But...

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:14.250
No book has told me why the insects 
suddenly appeared a century ago.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:17.310
I want to know! I must know!

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.970
Knowledge is everything to me!

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:23.210
That's why I've come to the common 
world that's filled with enemies.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.590
No matter what stands in my way,

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.480
I must get to the Insect Archives,

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.720
the records of the Insect Magistrate!

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.720
<i>Wh-What resolve!</i>

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:36.250
Couldn't we show him a little?

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:40.540
Um, I'm sorry but this place is off-limits.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.610
Sorry.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.370
Why? That's mean!

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.050
You could just let me have a look, couldn't you?

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.690
Huh? Why?

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:52.190
You're just some weirdo.

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:55.540
And I don't like the fact that 
you wear a Noh mask

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.270
when you talk to people.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.240
My face...

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:05.540
That's mean!

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.010
Give me back my face!

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.510
<i>He's really hot...</i>

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.820
<i>I've seen that face somewhere before...</i>

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:16.750
How rude! To steal someone's face!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.270
I know that you did that because you hate me!

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.520
That's why I hate petty officials.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.270
He got annoying when he put his mask on again.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.710
Why do you wear a mask, anyway?

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.660
Humans are liars.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.510
No one understands me.

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:36.410
I have a meeting...

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.670
So I'll be going.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:41.170
Jinbei-kun, see him home.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.240
We're not going to punish him?

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.870
He hasn't done anything.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.310
Let's go, Nagatomimaru-dono.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:50.970
No! I am going to Insect Archives!

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.790
Here, Tsukishima.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.800
Take him home.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:06:59.440
Okay!

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:04.380
<b>Insect Archives</b>

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:05.480
<b>Seal</b>

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:13.990
Nagatomimaru-dono, where do you live?

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:20.300
By the way, did you know

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.960
that some ranks of Magistrate 
are known as "Hacchoubori"

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:27.250
because their barracks are in Hacchoubori?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.880
They're also allowed in the women's 
bath early in the morning.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.590
What?

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:38.110
I am very moved by your passion for knowledge!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.530
Nagatomimaru-dono?

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:53.030
Let me down.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:54.830
But...

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.760
I said put me down.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.880
Yes... Right away.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.690
Um...

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:06.860
You can't deceive me with those eyes!

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:12.300
In your heart, you also think 
I'm stupid, don't you?

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:20.520
Enough!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.980
I'll go the rest of the way alone!

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.510
But I was ordered to take you back...

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:26.890
I don't care!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:35.570
<i>The first time in ten years I go outside, 
and I end up with nothing.</i>

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:38.230
<i>The common world is full of enemies.</i>

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:40.480
<i>I'm never going outside again.</i>

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.080
S-Save me...

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:48.500
Save me...

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:51.590
<b>Yabuka - Night Mosquito</b>

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.510
Oh, no.

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:11.170
It appears I've fallen asleep 
while reading my books.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:12.740
This is a dream.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:22.240
I bet the bug in this dream 
looks just like a real one.

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:25.710
When I think about it, this has 
been a strange night.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:32.760
A little girl yelling at me, a tiny boy 
carrying me, and now this bug?

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.760
It has to be a dream.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.510
Wait!

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:44.050
Are you okay?

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:48.060
Nagatomimaru-dono, are you hurt?

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:12.130
<i>He's fast!</i>

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.880
I see, I see...

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.410
This is very realistic.

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:27.030
Just like paintings I've seen of bug-slaying.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.750
What a dream.

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:33.110
If it's a dream, get rid of that thing!

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:55.580
<i>Th-That's impossible...</i>

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:56.920
<i>It must be a dream.</i>

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:04.020
<i>N-No one in reality would shed blood for me.</i>

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:19.250
<i>Only in a dream could anyone fight that monster.</i>

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:24.950
Nagatomimaru-dono, I'm sorry, 
but I have a request.

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:29.320
Please use your vast stores of knowledge

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:32.770
to tell me how to defeat this bug.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.210
What? Why would I do that?

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.430
I'm sorry to ask,

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:42.090
but I've no other means of winning this battle.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.480
But...

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:51.040
I know everything about insects, 
but not about monsters.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.100
Don't worry!

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:58.150
I believe in your passion for knowledge!

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.360
<i>Impossible...</i>

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:08.240
<i>Don't look at me with those trusting eyes.</i>

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.250
<i>I... I... I'm not like that.</i>

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:16.530
<i>I'm not worthy of being looked at that way.</i>

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:19.340
<i>Nagatomimaru-sama is no good.</i>

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.570
<i>Especially compared to His Lordship.</i>

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.060
<i>The second son will probably be the heir...</i>

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:24.560
<i>It's Nagatomimaru-sama.</i>

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:28.010
<i>What a splendid heir you will make!</i>

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:29.950
<i>Everyone is a liar.</i>

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:33.250
<i>No one thinks I'm "splendid."</i>

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.560
<i>No one respects me.</i>

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.010
<i>The only thing they respect is my position.</i>

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:44.990
<i>And then, I found a book in the storeroom.</i>

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.770
<i>The thirteenth volume of <i>Essays in Idleness.</i></i>

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:49.680
<i>Beneath the light,</i>

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:54.040
<i>I focus on reading, and it feels like 
the story's characters are my friends.</i>

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:56.540
<b>Yoshida Kenko</b>

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:56.540
<i>It becomes my life's greatest joy.</i>

00:12:57.270 --> 00:13:00.380
<i>When I read this passage, 
tears came to my eyes.</i>

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.580
<i>"It's okay to be alone."</i>

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.510
<i>I felt like the book was telling me this.</i>

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:08.490
<i>Books don't lie,</i>

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:12.770
<i>so I decided then that they 
would be my only friends.</i>

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:20.360
<i>And thus, I turned my gaze from 
the ephemeral, deceptive world.</i>

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.400
Don't worry!

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:36.260
Until you can share your wisdom with me,

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:39.370
I will keep fighting!

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:44.260
I abandoned my relationships with my 
fellow men and donned this mask,

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.060
and you still believe in me?

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.900
This must be true!

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:58.770
<i>I am very moved by your passion for knowledge!</i>

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:02.810
Since it's a dream, my vision is getting hazy,

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.280
and I can't see anything.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.490
But that's fine...

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:11.340
<i>Even if it's only a dream, 
I still want to help him.</i>

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.850
<i>Think! Analyze!</i>

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.730
<i>Don't let your knowledge go to waste.</i>

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:28.430
It disappeared?

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:33.740
That's it!

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.740
<i>Damn it, where did it go?</i>

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.550
Jinbei, was it?

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.160
Nagatomimaru-dono!

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:55.610
I'm glad to see you decided to 
make use of my knowledge.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.910
What is this smoke?

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.420
This smoke is from thatch and mugwort.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.210
It's used to repel a certain type of insect.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.520
It should at least slow a giant insect down.

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:19.690
Jeez, I was just about to get some sleep!

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:23.190
I'll get that bug for interrupting my sleep.

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.410
Now, Jinbei!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.140
Yes!

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.910
Always be ready for a fight!

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.420
Yay!

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:02.390
And then,

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:07.290
Jinbei said, "Please share 
your knowledge with me!"

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:10.780
Yes, you were wonderful, Nagatomimaru-dono!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.910
Wasn't I?

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.830
The most brilliant man in Japan!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.380
That's the tenth time I've heard that!

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:23.170
Did you see how brilliant I am, girl?

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.570
You useless girl!

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:25.860
Y-You little...

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.770
Very well.

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:30.160
I shall share my knowledge, as you are ignorant.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.800
What are you talking about?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.740
Who said you could be here, anyway?

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:35.800
Aw, come on.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.810
<i>Today was a splendid day.</i>

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:44.070
<i>I know! I'll come back tomorrow.</i>

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:47.560
<i>I must share more of my knowledge with Jinbei.</i>

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:58.040
This really does seem like a dream...

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:04.230
Partying somewhere I've never been,

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:06.630
and with people I don't know.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.990
It isn't a dream. It's real.

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:14.630
Oh, Jinbei...

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.390
Well, you see...

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.310
I am grateful, somewhat.

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:23.720
<i>Foolishness!</i>

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:26.120
<i>I've finally made it into the Insect Magistrate.</i>

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.400
<i>This is the chance of a lifetime!</i>

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:31.990
<i>The Insect Archives are right before me...</i>

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:38.020
<i>What wonderful knowledge must lie within!</i>

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:54.430
<i>It must be as great as the Momijiyama archives.</i>

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:58.180
<i>This book is about the insect's life cycle.</i>

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:03.080
<i>Here's a book about special 
weapons for fighting them.</i>

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.510
Records of the Magistrate!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:18.910
What is this?

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:42.970
I don't know this crest. 
And that makes me angry.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.660
It's very tightly wound.

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:48.330
What a pain.

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:55.020
This map is of the Land of the Rising Sun.

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:57.740
But what is this?

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:07.500
We are investigating that... 
Tokugawa Ieshige-sama.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:13.500
I finally remembered seeing you in Edo castle.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.470
You...

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:19.150
The eldest son of the eighth 
shogun, Yoshimune-sama.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.890
Tokugawa Ieshige-sama, the next shogun.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.510
What is this, magistrate officer?

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:28.350
Ieshige-sama, why don't you and I make a deal?

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:38.800
If you agree to keep secret what you saw here,

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:42.440
I will not reveal your identity.

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:48.260
Does this relate to the fact that the spies 
we sent to Kyoto have not returned?

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.720
What lies beyond Kishuu?

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.290
I cannot answer that.

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:58.860
None of the citizens,

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:01.680
and only a select few of the
 shogunate know this secret.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:04.290
Even you cannot be told.

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:10.240
I ask that you never return to 
the Insect Magistrate's Office.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:17.250
I will keep this secret.

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:19.650
However,

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:23.160
every day, from now on, 
I will come to see Jinbei.

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:25.330
